        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "After the tyrant's death, the Phyton mobilized many refugees to join the garrison and restructured the city's defenses. The updated schedule is as follows:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Guard shifts at the Marmoreal Market have increased in frequency — from Action Hour to Curtain-Fall Hour, all patrols along the Path of Parting will begin one quint earlier."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Take careful note of these changes to avoid unnecessary complications."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*The note appears to have been smoothed flat then curled again, suggesting it was once rolled inside a secret message cylinder.*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-ccb9ca5cc4c39c5d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-dfc3ab3590c469d6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ", high priest of the Flame-Chasers."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A middle-aged with gray hair, stooped posture, and a burn scar on the right side of the neck. Visits the chanting hall alone to pray during Entry Hour's first quint ."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "An exposed iron nail will be placed on the stair railing. , an accident might silence him permanently."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "''"
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Dark, crusted bloodstains have obscured the text, and the names have been deliberately smeared away by bloody fingers."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "''"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-96cc20b1be724b57"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-dfc3ab3590c469d6-2"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Phyton and the Maiden have been frequently visiting the Twilight Courtyard lately to meet with healers."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In their conversations, they've mentioned the Skyfolk and the Daythunder Knight's past affairs. The day to reclaim Aquila's Coreflame appears to be imminent —"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A thousand-year-old grudge will be settled then. Make preparations, for that moment draws near."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "''"
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "...written on the inner side of a clean bandage, emitting a dry, herbal fragrance."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "''"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-51a0105c49bf6d1b"
          }
